    "directions": [
      "In a pan, add peanuts and dry roast it for a few minutes or until light golden on medium flames.",
      "Transfer it to a tray and deskin it by rubbing with the help of hands or with the cloth.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a grinder jar, add roasted peanuts and grind it into coarse powder.",
      "Add coconut oil, salt to taste and grind it until smooth.",
      "Add honey, peanut oil and grind it well for a minute.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl and keep aside for further use.",
      "Store it in a cleaned and airtight container.",
      "In a grinder jar, add prepared base peanut butter, dark chocolate, peanut oil and grind it well.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl and keep aside for further use.",
      "Store it in a cleaned and airtight container.",
      "In a grinder jar, add prepared base peanut butter, peanut oil, honey and grind into a smooth paste.",
      "Add peanut oil and grind it well for a minute.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl and keep aside for further use.",
      "Store it in a cleaned and airtight container.",
      "In a grinder jar, add prepared base peanut butter, peanut oil, honey and grind it to a smooth paste. Add roasted peanuts and grind it for a few seconds.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl and keep aside for further use.",
      "Store it in a cleaned and airtight container.",
      "In a grinder jar, add banana, chocolate peanut butter, milk, a few ice cubes, honey and grind it into a thick shake.",
      "Transfer it to a serving glass, garnish it with chocolate chips and banana slices.",
      "Serve chill.",
      "Spread smooth peanut butter on one bread slice and chocolate peanut butter on another bread slice.",
      "Add banana and make a sandwich.",
      "In a pan add butter, place the toast and toast it from both the sides.",
      "Cut it into a half and transfer it to a serving dish."
    ],
